<speak>
chapter 1. a little bonus for you.
<break time="600ms"/>
<break time="1.5s" />
<break time="600ms"/>
this book is about breaking cycles and putting down the weight you never chose. but sometimes what heals us most is simply reading words from someone who gets it.
<break time="600ms"/>
that’s why i created the eldest daughters’ letters . a collection of raw, honest letters written to eldest daughters everywhere. letters to remind you you’re not alone, to put into words what you’ve been carrying, and to give you something to come back to on the heavy days.
<break time="600ms"/>
you’ll find out how to grab your free copy at the end of this book.
</speak>
